Q5. Second Largest Unique Number
================================
numbers = [45, 12, 89, 34, 89, 67, 45, 23]

# Step 1: Duplicate numbers hatana
unique_numbers = set(numbers)  # Result: {12, 23, 34, 45, 67, 89}

# Step 2: Set ko wapas list main badlna
unique_list = list(unique_numbers)

# Step 3: List ko chote se bade ki taraf sort karna
unique_list.sort()  # Result:

# Step 4: Aakhir se doosra (second-largest) element nikalna
second_largest = unique_list[-2]

print("Second Largest Unique Number:", second_largest)

